      ### 4. [TASK] 2026-01-01T00:04:00Z — `T3`
      
      T3: Error messages (in P1; needs T2; writes src/errors.py)
      
      ### 5. [LESSON] 2026-01-01T00:05:00Z
      
      Pin the grammar before refactoring it: Snapshot parser output first
      
      ### 6. [DECISION] 2026-01-01T00:06:00Z
      
      Hand-written parser
      
      Decision: Recursive descent, no generator
      
      Governs: src/**
      
      ### 7. [RESEARCH] 2026-01-01T00:09:00Z — `P1`
      **Verdict: CONFIRMED**
      
      Is recursive descent fast enough? -> It parses 10k lines in under 50ms
      
      ### 8. [SHIPPED] 2026-01-01T00:10:00Z — `T1`
      
      T1
      
  
    ''',
